\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "pedgene"

\end_inset


\change_unchanged
 R package to carry out gene-based association tests on family data using
 selected marker subsets, 
\change_inserted -1820302391 1508515131
the Mega2SKAT function to run the SKAT 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "SKATa"

\end_inset

 R package to carry out gene-based association tests on family data using
 selected marker subsets, 
\change_unchanged
the Mega2VCF function to output the Mega2R data as a VCF file and related
 files (for phenotype and family data), and the Mega2GenABEL function to
 convert the data frames into GenABEL R gwaa.data-class objects 
