\begin_layout Standard
There are two ways to compute a function on all the genotypes (or markers)
 in a transcript.
 These examples are explained more thoroughly in Section 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "subsec:pedgene"

\end_inset

